{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/f52ec61187f5dee91640509fe456fa1e.poster.avif?t=1770724167\" width=616 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/f52ec61187f5dee91640509fe456fa1e.webm?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/f52ec61187f5dee91640509fe456fa1e.mp4?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the creators of Bus Simulator 21 and Bus Simulator 18 comes Bus Bound, an all-new driving-focused experience set in the evolving city of Emberville. Take the wheel of licensed American buses and turn everyday routes into a journey of urban transformation.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/9b512baf321400640e74f40115c00874.poster.avif?t=1770724167\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/9b512baf321400640e74f40115c00874.webm?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/9b512baf321400640e74f40115c00874.mp4?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Emberville: a fully simulated, densely inhabited fictional town alive with traffic systems, a dynamic day/night cycle, and multiple weather conditions. From bustling intersections to quiet neighborhoods, every area has its own rhythm, and your route helps shape its future.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/09d3693a0ed82b9d889a77c9f1dc0df3.poster.avif?t=1770724167\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/09d3693a0ed82b9d889a77c9f1dc0df3.webm?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/09d3693a0ed82b9d889a77c9f1dc0df3.mp4?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel of true-to-life buses from top American manufacturers, including the New Flyer Xcelsior 40ft CNG and the Blue Bird Sigma. With a growing lineup of over a dozen vehicles at launch, you\u2019ll always have the right bus for the job.<br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/ff6313f83e54a56fa50ccf2f887df54e.poster.avif?t=1770724167\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/ff6313f83e54a56fa50ccf2f887df54e.webm?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/ff6313f83e54a56fa50ccf2f887df54e.mp4?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just driving, you\u2019re improving public life. Upgrade stops, unlock new routes, earn passive perks, and see each district evolve into a more vibrant, pedestrian-friendly space.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/449bf5c1c39899530a78f8026b1a36d9.poster.avif?t=1770724167\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/449bf5c1c39899530a78f8026b1a36d9.webm?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/449bf5c1c39899530a78f8026b1a36d9.mp4?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Band together with up to 3 other players! Split off to tackle multiple simultaneous routes and cooperate to contribute to your host\u2019s goal to improve and elevate Emberville.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/5f9b80a0dc01c7e67d21329ed073a4b7.poster.avif?t=1770724167\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/5f9b80a0dc01c7e67d21329ed073a4b7.webm?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/5f9b80a0dc01c7e67d21329ed073a4b7.mp4?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run by run, generate good-will with your riders to unlock new buses, visual styles and upgrades. Whether you prefer a relaxing driving experience or want to master and optimize every detail of your runs\u2013sit behind the wheel and make your trip your own.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2095420?t=1770724167","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/64ff23920e2bb56defce043e4943d1526892deab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770724167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/97866de3ef8943b26e713eddf58d2cbc3fed6b7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770724167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/97866de3ef8943b26e713eddf58d2cbc3fed6b7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770724167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4010830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/f52ec61187f5dee91640509fe456fa1e.poster.avif?t=1770724167\" width=616 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/f52ec61187f5dee91640509fe456fa1e.webm?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/f52ec61187f5dee91640509fe456fa1e.mp4?t=1770724167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the creators of Bus Simulator 21 and Bus Simulator 18 comes Bus Bound, an all-new driving-focused experience set in the evolving city of Emberville. Take the wheel of licensed American buses and turn everyday routes into a journey of urban transformation.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/extras/9b512baf321400640e74f40115c00874.poster.avif?t=1770724167\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as